<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>Arata is going to be reborn.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The age when only the settlement's own people protected it is over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
You can protect Arata from the outside world, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As long as <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> keeps it in her heart, Arata won't disappear.
{PAUSE ""}
